Time zone data: the clock uses the IANA time zone database through the
JavaScript Intl API of the runtime it runs on (Cloudflare Workers in
production). The database itself is not bundled with this repository; it is in
the public domain.

Third-party code: none is bundled. The project has no runtime or build
dependencies. Wrangler (Cloudflare) is an optional external tool used during
development and is not distributed with this repository.

